what depends on it<br>\n…</p>\n<p>if removing cups is the last thing you did you can get the list of things you removed by:<br>\n<code>sudo dnf history list last info</code></p>\n<p>or</p>\n<p><code>sudo dnf history list --reverse</code><br>\nfind the line with cups, and get the transaction number</p>\n<p><code>sudo dnf history info &lt;transaction number&gt;</code></p>\n<p>will also give you the the packages that were removed.</p>\n<p>Then you can either install by hand</p>\n<p>or</p>\n<p><code>sudo dnf history undo &lt;transaction number&gt; </code></p>\n<p>sorry about that</p>", "post_number": 2, "topic_id": 57683, "url": "/t/cups-dnf-dependencies/57683/2"}], "has_accepted_answer": true, "shared_issue_count": 0, "can_create_shared_issue": false, "shared_issue_visible": true, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id": null, "discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url": "https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/", "details": {"can_edit": false, "notification_level": 1, "participants": [{"id": 4096, "username": "bryguy", "name": "FAS Bryan A. Zimmer", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/b/ffd117/{size}.png", "post_count": 2, "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "trust_level": 1}, {"id": 638, "username": "grumpey", "name": "Joe Walker", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/grumpey/{size}/54040_2.png", "post_count": 1, "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "trust_level": 4}, {"id": 2081, "username": "ilikelinux", "name": "ilikelinux", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/ilikelinux/{size}/27169_2.png", "post_count": 1, "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_color": "", "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "trust_level": 2}], "created_by": {"